{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Which products could you recommend? Make sure the use and priority options separate them from each other.","Is budget a number people will happily give, or would ranges feel less exposing for your customers?","Do you sell many gifts? If not, remove the gift branch.","Who writes the recommendations, and how quickly can they reply?"],"howToUseResponses":"Start from the top-ranked priority, then use the budget to narrow the list, and name one clear pick with a short reason tied to their answers. Add a second option only when two products are genuinely close. Reply first to gift buyers with a near date. Every few weeks, look at which requests you could not fill well; they point at gaps in your range.","customizeSteps":["Rewrite the use options, the ranking items and the currency to match what you sell.","Edit the ending with the reply time your team can keep.","Embed the form on product pages or share the link from your chat and social profiles, then answer requests from the dashboard."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a product recommendation form ask?","a":"What the person is looking for, who it is for, how it will be used, what matters most, their budget and anything they want to avoid. Those answers are enough to suggest one good product."},{"q":"Is this a quiz that picks a product automatically?","a":"No. It collects needs so a person on your team can reply with a considered recommendation. If you want automatic results, a product recommendation quiz is the better fit."},{"q":"Why use a ranking question for priorities?","a":"Ask people to rate everything and they rate everything as important. Ranking forces a choice, which is exactly what you need to decide between two similar products."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Product recommendation","description":"Learn what a shopper needs so your team can suggest the right product.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_productr00","ref":"welcome","title":"Not sure what to choose? Answer a few questions and one of our team will send you a personal recommendation.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_productr01","ref":"looking_for","title":"What are you looking for?","description":"Rough is fine: a type of product, a problem you want solved or something you've seen.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_productr02","ref":"for_whom","title":"Who is it for?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_me","label":"Me","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_someone_else_as","label":"Someone else, as a gift","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_my_team_or","label":"My team or business","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_productr03","ref":"recipient","title":"Tell us a little about them: age, interests, anything they already have","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":300},{"id":"blk_productr04","ref":"needed_by","title":"When do you need it by?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"date","disablePast":true,"dateFormat":"YYYY-MM-DD","includeTime":false,"timeStepMinutes":30,"timeMin":"09:00","timeMax":"18:00"},{"id":"blk_productr05","ref":"use","title":"How will it mostly be used?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_every_day","label":"Every day","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_now_and_then","label":"Now and then","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_outdoors_or_on","label":"Outdoors or on the move","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_at_home","label":"At home","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_at_work","label":"At work","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":5,"allowOther":true},{"id":"blk_productr06","ref":"priorities","title":"Put these in order of what matters most to you","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"ranking","items":[{"id":"opt_item_price","label":"Price"},{"id":"opt_item_quality_and","label":"Quality and durability"},{"id":"opt_item_looks_and","label":"Looks and design"},{"id":"opt_item_ease_of","label":"Ease of use"},{"id":"opt_item_sustainability","label":"Sustainability"}]},{"id":"blk_productr07","ref":"experience","title":"How familiar are you with this kind of product?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"opinion_scale","steps":5,"startAt":1,"labelLow":"Complete beginner","labelHigh":"I know exactly what I want"},{"id":"blk_productr08","ref":"budget","title":"What's the most you'd like to spend?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"number","unique":false,"min":0,"integerOnly":false,"currency":"USD"},{"id":"blk_productr09","ref":"avoid","title":"Anything you definitely don't want? A brand, material, colour or size.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":200},{"id":"blk_productr10","ref":"email","title":"Where should we send your recommendation?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"email","unique":false,"businessOnly":false,"allowedDomains":[],"verify":false},{"id":"blk_productr11","ref":"call","title":"Would you like a quick call to talk it through as well?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_productr12","ref":"phone","title":"What number should we call?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"phone","unique":false,"verify":false}],"endings":[{"id":"end_productr01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Thanks, we're on it 🛍️","bodyMd":"Someone from our team will look at your answers and email you a recommendation, usually within one business day.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]}],"endingRules":[],"logic":[{"id":"rl_productr01","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"for_whom"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_me"}],"groups":[]},"from":"for_whom","target":"use","targetKind":"block","branch":"true"},{"id":"rl_productr02","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"for_whom"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_my_team_or"}],"groups":[]},"from":"for_whom","target":"use","targetKind":"block","branch":"true"},{"id":"rl_productr03","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"for_whom"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_someone_else_as"}],"groups":[]},"from":"for_whom","target":"recipient","targetKind":"block","branch":"true"},{"id":"rl_productr04","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"call"},"op":"eq","value":false}],"groups":[]},"from":"call","target":"end_thanks","targetKind":"ending","branch":"true"}],"layout":{},"variables":[],"hiddenFields":[],"settings":{"language":"en","languages":[],"rtl":false,"progressBar":"percent","navigation":{"allowBack":true,"allowSkip":true},"closeRules":{"closedMessageMd":"This form is no longer accepting responses.","showCountdown":true,"showRemaining":false},"requireAuth":{"enabled":false,"method":"google","message":"Before we start, could you verify who you are? It only takes a moment.","afterBlocks":0},"password":{"enabled":false,"value":""},"captcha":{"enabled":true,"provider":"turnstile","mode":"adaptive"},"allowResubmissions":true,"onComplete":{"requireSubmit":true,"notifyOwner":true,"notificationEmails":[],"notificationReplyTo":"","notificationSubjec